sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant Hook as useAnonymousSession
  participant API as Hono Anonymous API
  participant Store as DynamoDB

  U->>Hook: Load application
  Hook->>API: GET /api/auth/anonymous
  API->>Store: Save refresh hash + TTL
  API-->>Hook: Set cookies (access + refresh)

  loop Protected requests
    Hook->>API: Fetch /api/wallcrawler/... with cookies
    API->>Hook: Refresh access cookie when valid
  end

  alt Access expired but refresh valid
    Hook->>API: POST /api/auth/anonymous/refresh
    API->>Store: Validate + rotate hash
    API-->>Hook: New cookies
  else Refresh invalid/expired
    API-->>Hook: 401 Invalid refresh
    Hook->>API: GET /api/auth/anonymous (start over)
  end
